		{
			"eventType": "comment",
			"text": "Save Event Sheet: Contains helper functions to save, load, and delete user data"
		},
		{
			"eventType": "comment",
			"text": "HOW TO USE:\n- include this event sheet to event sheets when needing to save or load\n- to save, call save_userdata and pass along the last lvl completed by the user\n- to load, call load_userdata (if action depends on user data being loaded first, call it on loaded signal)\n\nloading example in cutscene_1a_events"
		},
